[#D7D7AF]fail-closed bounds validation, and Rust tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ChopReport builder in the sase.chops SDK[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sdk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sdk: add a typed `ChopReport` builder plus `ChopResultBuilder.report` to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the public `sase.chops` SDK so chop packages compose reports without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hand-writing JSON or markup, and document the contract in docs/axe.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]AXE chop-run result card and report rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: build the shared block renderer and repaint the AXE chop-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail pane as RESULT card, REPORT, then OUTPUT, width-responsive and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cached, and reuse the same renderer for `sase axe chop run`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PNG snapshot coverage for chop reports[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: add AXE-tab PNG snapshot fixtures and goldens covering a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report-rich run, a report-less run, a failing run, and a narrow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]terminal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reports for every bugyi-chops chop[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chops[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sdk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chops: author reports for ci_watch, toobig_split, recent_bug_audit, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recent_improvement_audit in the bugyi-chops repo behind one shared house[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]style, and unify toobig_split's clan summary with its report.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification on the real AXE tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after visual, chops[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: run each bugyi chop against the real configuration, confirm the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AXE tab renders each report correctly at several widths, and confirm no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi config change is required.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ar","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ar.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-77dcb7fcaa181ce041ed5634717c3e87","started_at":"2026-07-29T13:51:10.236138+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785335279,"sha":"bc501e595b0ee0e09d915daf68b7528b1bc50a84","subject":"feat(axe): render structured chop result reports"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ae7263c364c585a8a835f8e1b890d4820aa1e3b6159da501aa1de9ad21e11f75","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/chat.md","size_bytes":7177},"commits":{"digest":"bbb2cd1632b991c5d9dd6cbefc38995980050b38e14f5445ca25b87989ae61ea","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/commits.json","size_bytes":226},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"d4ec400246f05c3758c09d6ee4583421e31cd8839149390791baa780c07e8fa3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"0124972062d215f60e3b0